        - Debit Notification Redundancy Index
        - Trust Signal Deviation Score
        explanation: >
        This initiative neutralizes a key emotional trigger — duplicate alerts during sensitive financial moments — which previously caused fear, misinterpretation, and perceived fraud. By aligning with SBP and GLBA standards, it safeguards customer trust while ensuring audit-ready compliance. The selected KPIs track the success of deduplication logic, emotional noise reduction, and measurable impact on user trust telemetry. Ops, Risk, and Product teams will co-own execution.

    - initiative: "Notification UX Guardrails"
        strategic_pillars:
        - Customer-Centricity
        - Brand Differentiation
        - Risk Management & Compliance
        outcome: >
        Clarify financial notifications to reduce panic, improve interpretation, and reinforce trust at the moment of payment confirmation or failure.
        metrics:
